        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Schweizerischer Niederlaufhund, Portuguese Podengo\n- Concepts: dog breeds, scenthounds, multi-sensory hounds\n- Places: Switzerland, Portugal\n\nFacts:\n- The Schweizerischer Niederlaufhund is a dog breed from Switzerland.\n- The Schweizerischer Niederlaufhund is FCI No. 60 and is translated into English as the Small Swiss Hound.\n- The Schweizerischer Niederlaufhund is a scenthound-type dog breed.\n- The Portuguese Podengo is an ancient dog breed from Portugal.\n- The Portuguese Podengo is a multi-sensory hound that uses both sight and scent.",
